Thus all nine ascending positions are:
Mercury, Mars, Venus, Pluto, Earth, Uranus, Neptune, Saturn, Jupiter.
The candidate uses nine separately labelled position parts rather than
requiring one arbitrary punctuation serialization of the entire sequence.
Each position has a unique named-body result; English figure names and
